  "meta": {
    "name": "Warm Hall",
    "author": "Resonance",
    "description": "Medium concert hall: 3.2 s decay with the bass held to 1.35x and the treble cut to 0.5x above 4 kHz, sparse early reflections and a moderate build. A warm back layer for vocals, strings and piano.",
